            "pageDisplayName": "Please Read",
            "content": [
                {
                    "text": "<font size='24' align='center'>Where are the configurations?</font><br /><font size='14'>Configuartion of device actions can be done in Data/F4SE/Telekinesis/*. <br /> For more info, read the docs: https://github.com/garryrot/lovebug</font>",
                    "type": "text",
                    "html": true
                },
                {
                    "text": "<font size='14'>After changing the configuration files, you need to restart the game, or reconnect on the settings page, otherwise they will not have any effect.</font>",
